 {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἴσα τὸν ἀ."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 441c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ποτὴν ἴσον equal in flight of song,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Alex.Aet. 5.5", "author_abbreviation": "Alex.Aet.", "tlg_author": "0216", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἴσον, τό , copy of a document,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "PLond. 3.1222.5", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(ii A.D.), etc.: with dat. pers. in place of an object of comparison, οὐ μὲν σοί ποτε ἶσον ἔχω γέρας (i.e. τῷ σῷ γέραϊ)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.163", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τοῖσδ' ἴσας ναῦς (i.e. ταῖς τῶνδε)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. IA 262", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(lyr.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἴσα τοῖς νῦν στρατηγοῖς ἀγάθ' εἰργασμένους D. 13.21", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "013", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": folld. by a relative word, ἐμοὶ ἴσον . . , ὅσονπερ ὑμῖν the same to me as to you,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ec. 173", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "010", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὰ ἐκεῖ ἴσα, ὥσπερ τὰ ἐνθάδε Lys. 19.36", "author_abbreviation": "Lys.", "tlg_author": "0540", "tlg_work": "019", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "codd. (fort. σᾶ); τὰ ἴσα ὅσαπερ . . Lex ap."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 23.44", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "023", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἴσον . . ὅπερ Pl. Erx. 405b", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "038", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". repeated to denote equal relations, ἴσα πρὸς ἴσα tit for tat,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.2", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ταχθέντες ἴσοι πρὸς ἴσους S. Ant. 142", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(anap.);"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἴσους ἴσοισι . . ἀντιθείς E. Ph. 750", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "015", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἴσα ἀντὶ ἴσων λαμβάνειν, ἐκδοῦναι Pl. Lg. 774c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "034", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἴσος ἴσῳ (sc. οἶνος ὕδατι)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Cratin. 184", "author_abbreviation": "Cratin.", "tlg_author": "0434", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ","}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Com.Adesp. 107", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; κύλικος ἴσον ἴσῳ κεκραμένης (where ἴσον is adverbial)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Pl. 1132", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "διδόναι γάλα καὶ οἶνον πίνειν ἴσον ἴσῳ Hp. Epid. 2.5.1", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": "0627", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": metaph., 'fairly blended',"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μηδὲν ἴσον ἴσῳ φέρων Ar. Ach. 354", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". of persons, equal in rights,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "βούλεται ἡ πόλις ἐξ ἴσων εἶναι καὶ ὁμοίων Arist. Pol. 1295b25", "author_abbreviation": "Arist.", "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "035", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἡ πολιτικὴ ἐλευθέρων καὶ ἴσων ἀρχή ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1255b20", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "035", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὸ κατ' ἀξίαν ἴ. ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1307a26", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0086", "tlg_work": "035", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al. equally divided or distributed,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἴση μοῖρα Il. 9.318", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἴση alone, one's equal share,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μή τίς μοι ἀτεμβόμενος κίοι ἴσης Od. 9.42", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(ἴσσης cj. Fick, cf. ἴσσασθαι)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "; τὴν ἴ. ἔχων Cratin. 250", "author_abbreviation": "Cratin.", "tlg_author": "0434", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὐ μὴν ἴ. ἔτεισεν (sc. τίσιν)"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OT 810", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἄχρι τῆς ἴ. up to the point of equality,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "D. 5.17", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": neut.,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "μὴ ἴσον νεῖμαι ἑκατέρῳ Pl. Prt. 337a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οὐ μόνον ἴσον, ἀλλὰ καὶ πλέον ἔχειν Isoc. 17.57", "author_abbreviation": "Isoc.", "tlg_author": "0010", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὐκ ἀνέξῃ δωμάτων ἔχων ἴσον καὶ τῷδε νεῖμαι;"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Ph. 547", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "015", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὰ ἴσα fair measure,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὰ ἴ. νέμειν Hdt. 6.11", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; μὴ ἴσων ἕκαστον τυγχάνειν ἀλλὰ πλεονεκτεῖν,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. Cyr. 2.2.20", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; προστυχεῖν τῶν ἴ. to obtain fair terms,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. Ph. 552", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; κἂν ἴσαι (sc. ψῆφοι) γένωνται equally divided,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Ar. Ra. 685", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "009", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". based on equality of rights,"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἴ. καὶ ἔννομος πολιτ εία Aeschin. 1.5", "author_abbreviation": "Aeschin.", "tlg_author": "0026", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὴν πολιτείαν ἰσαιτέραν καθιστάναι Th. 8.89", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὰ ἴ. equal rights, equality, freq. joined with τὰ ὅμοια or"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὰ δίκαια, ὡς τῆς πολιτείας ἐσομένης ἐν τοῖς ἴ. καὶ ὁμοίοις X. HG 7.1.45", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ";"}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τῶν ἴ. καὶ τῶν δικαίων ἕκαστος ἡγεῖται ἑαυτῷ μετεῖναι ἐν τῇ δημοκρατίᾳ D. 21.67", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "021", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; οὐ μέτεστι τῶν ἴ. οὐδὲ τῶν ὁμοίων πρὸς τοὺς πλουσίους τοῖς λοιποῖς ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "t